THIRD-PARTY AND DATA NOTICES

No third-party code is included.

No real or licensed market data is included or redistributed. All prices, tickers
and liquidity tiers are synthetic, generated deterministically by
scripts/generate_synthetic_data.py with a fixed seed.

Fee, calendar, settlement and price-limit values are approximations compiled by
the authors from public sources (published legislation, published exchange rules,
and published tax guidance) for academic use. They are not official data. See
README.md, "Provenance and attribution", for what each class of value
approximates and how far each was verified.

This is a simulated research artifact, not a trading system. It is not connected
to, endorsed by, or representative of any exchange, broker, depository, regulator
or trading venue, and it does not execute, route or settle orders.
